## Before shipping lab edits

1. Grep for `USE ROLE FR_` — every hit must be followed by `USE SECONDARY ROLES NONE` in the same copy block (or next line).
2. Grep for `ARCH_INTERVIEW`, `WH_ARCH`, `ROLE_ARCH`, `AR_RAW`, `SnowShop` — must not appear in student-facing lab steps (cleanup SQL may mention old names).
3. HTML SQL must match `sql/*.sql`.
